files.description:
Non-destructive surface cutaways for inspection, never replacement assets.

Cut boundaries stay open. The separate section drawing describes cut material;
blindly filling boundaries here could falsely cap a real hollow component.

definitions.description:
Assign every pixel of a whole-object view to the part whose own views' colours explain it best;
returns {part: (u0, u1, v0, v1)} as fractions of the view's object box (v from the top), or nothing
for a part that isn't visible.

hull_prop voxel_hook: a part whose top view is round is a lathe about the vertical axis (a carafe);
one whose front view is round is a lathe about the front-to-back axis (a dial, a cap). Boxy slices
become ellipses; appendages (a handle, a finger stop) keep their hull.

files.description:
Source-aware checks for the extrude line. No Blender dependency in this module.

The profile comparison tests the exported cap geometry against the source section;
it must not test only the profile that the generator *intended* to create.
